          "en": "a string that's either ASC or DESC.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.74,
          "end": 51.74,
          "en": "And I'll start with DESC as a default, let's say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 51.93,
          "end": 54.39,
          "en": "to be in line with the defaults",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 54.39,
          "end": 57.06,
          "en": "I am managing here on that link.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 57.06,
          "end": 58.89,
          "en": "Now, order is a signal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 58.89,
          "end": 61.44,
          "en": "So down here when I set it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 61.44,
          "end": 63.96,
